{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02518",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.56,
      "end_seconds": 5.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Good evening, um, doctor, thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.63,
      "end_seconds": 10.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.27,
      "end_seconds": 20.04,
      "duration_seconds": 8.77,
      "text": "I've been dealing with a sudden high fever. My sister suggested writing things down, uh, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.87,
      "end_seconds": 25.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.33,
      "end_seconds": 30.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "I've had it for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.32,
      "end_seconds": 37.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Okay, and what about stiff neck, sore throat or cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.99,
      "end_seconds": 41.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "None of those, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.08,
      "end_seconds": 45.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Understood. Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.34,
      "end_seconds": 49.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.33,
      "end_seconds": 53.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.87,
      "end_seconds": 57.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "My daughter has type 1 diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.17,
      "end_seconds": 69.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.67,
      "end_seconds": 79.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "I'm on allopurinol, once a day for the gout."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.23,
      "end_seconds": 83.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.18,
      "end_seconds": 89.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "100 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.51,
      "end_seconds": 95.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Alright, any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.66,
      "end_seconds": 100.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Ah, no, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.66,
      "end_seconds": 103.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.86,
      "end_seconds": 107.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Gout, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.5,
      "end_seconds": 116.35,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "Yes, gout is known to us, good to have that clear. Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.04,
      "end_seconds": 125.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.26,
      "end_seconds": 130.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.44,
      "end_seconds": 136.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.45,
      "end_seconds": 152.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Okay, any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.22,
      "end_seconds": 155.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.45,
      "end_seconds": 167.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.16,
      "end_seconds": 181.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.18,
      "end_seconds": 211.61,
      "duration_seconds": 9.43,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.6, oxygen saturation is 98 percent. And pressure 94 over 63, respiratory rate 20, pulse is 96 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.87,
      "end_seconds": 226.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "From what you've told me, this is probably possible toxic shock syndrome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.98,
      "end_seconds": 231.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.18,
      "end_seconds": 264.86,
      "duration_seconds": 31.68,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's possible toxic shock syndrome, and we'll know more once the a vaginal swab is back. Let's book a vaginal swab to look into possible toxic shock. We'll begin with flucloxacillin, 2 grams, now, single dose. It's for possible toxic shock syndrome. Remove any tampon, you are going to hospital now. Let's get you seen by the emergency team, I'll arrange the letter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.96,
      "end_seconds": 274.2,
      "duration_seconds": 8.24,
      "text": "Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. I'd like to see you again straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.35,
      "end_seconds": 279.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "I mean, I'll note it in my calendar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.44,
      "end_seconds": 285.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "What are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.15,
      "end_seconds": 294.65,
      "duration_seconds": 8.5,
      "text": "So, I take the flucloxacillin, 2 grams, now and come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.74,
      "end_seconds": 301.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.51,
      "end_seconds": 306.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}